+                    active_start.elapsed(), requested_duration, final_left_c, final_right_c, left_target_centideg,
+                    right_target_centideg, final_heatsink_c, left_pump_activity_observed, right_pump_activity_observed,
+                    top_fan_latest_rpm, bottom_fan_latest_rpm,
