+    /// telemetry (see `termination_signal_future_does_not_resolve_spuriously` for proof that future
+    /// never resolves spuriously), and on any resolution simply falls through to the same
+    /// `run_cool_test_shutdown` call every other exit path uses -- there is no separate "exit
+    /// immediately" branch for a signal anywhere in this file.
